{
  "_help": [
    "Builds the bots work towards. Each slot names a petal FAMILY (see 'families' below).",
    "A family lists the real petals best-first (e.g. 'stinger' = Legendary Stinger, then Stinger).",
    "'standIns' are what a bot uses in that slot until it gets the real thing.",
    "Goal builds: 'weight' = how often bots pick it (higher = more popular / better ranked).",
    "'heal': 'equipped' = healing stays in the loadout; 'bench' = Roses wait on the bench and get swapped in to heal.",
    "'stepping' = an easier build to play while collecting the pieces for a hard-to-get goal.",
    "'tactic': special move - 'bubble' (Bubble-dash away from danger), 'web' (drop webs while farming).",
    "'style': how the build leans - 'kill', 'lean-kill', 'hybrid', 'lean-farm' or 'farm'. Bots pick builds that match how aggressive they are (aggressive -> kill, calm -> farm, in between -> hybrid)."
